    "Linux source capture uses the real built ModelStage and same exact GLB/viewer/preset; frame0 PNG alpha equals selected poster exactly. No live browser was operated by this review.",
    "Preserved exact-code actual GLB screenshots remain consistent in angle, position and color with new frame7, both visually and by offline center-crop parity. New-image browser handoff/reproduction must still run after integrator activation."
